            <div xml:id="m-0d840557-e9d4-4467-9e9c-d6179d9f6e08">
              <lg xml:id="m-9ed9a07b-ea55-4fb7-9b0e-db67653d45b9">
                <l xml:id="m-d26223de-6ee6-462f-b448-4526b7b4dc98" facs="#m-a89ca751-c3e6-450d-97c8-35f7d407f8e8" label="ambiguous">494</l><l xml:id="m-5c702c90-b7a4-448a-bc17-24dcd64c2511" facs="#m-1a3b9b4f-430b-40b0-a34a-cc1c1e1a97ba" label="text-like">eth Sunday after the Epiphany.</l><l xml:id="m-d60f3c8b-4032-4964-8bc7-bb85b8997855" facs="#m-d0022947-1a55-4968-aa1c-143551a04006" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-80fd244c-7bbd-45b9-9202-d884fe782271" facs="#m-b2227370-452e-4445-bcf4-3b08a323a458" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus, omnípotens Deus: ctum, cujus per haec mystéria pi¬</l><l xml:id="m-2cc9e3e0-e058-413a-ae2e-16835eb4daed" facs="#m-95393fce-5cd5-4d32-a15a-0a01ec493897" label="lyrics-like">Lut illius salutáris capiámus effé¬ gnus accépimus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-46f80200-d298-4f71-a45e-4b955badbea6" facs="#m-a7787162-1161-4cb1-9f02-b1c82deedc95" label="lyrics-like">Second Postcommunion. Mundet et múniat. p. 502. Third at the priest's</l><l xml:id="m-066ca07f-88b5-4626-94d6-01332197ecee" facs="#m-d34df9ca-4ab7-4928-bfc0-5744fec08366" label="ambiguous">choice.</l><l xml:id="m-bddba166-5ad5-47e1-9159-51392b43073f" facs="#m-66dff99c-fdbf-4f15-b4a9-f9e9b3f55543" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-be369bec-a20c-4453-9fe9-00f63b0f0278" facs="#m-922ab9cf-5d20-42c4-baf0-ab6a960ef37f" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-2b8170b6-8b09-4e18-8e2f-f4db461ca719" facs="#m-0d5a2738-e163-4205-bce2-8c8e7f315171" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.g</l><l xml:id="m-23c941bd-c3a8-4177-95e8-25b847e941d2" facs="#m-d3b51d86-45a8-4518-818b-cc2359332cc3" label="lyrics-like">Ollí-gi-te" primum zizáni¬ a</l><l xml:id="m-dd66445a-6022-48cb-986d-f649ecbe1079" facs="#m-3571d7a2-45ea-4a23-b1f6-d2ca6c567003" label="lyrics-like">et alligáte</l><l xml:id="m-2938301e-ae04-4414-8310-62d4c5e0b6e6" facs="#m-eca0b265-aeee-41c2-9076-4b91c53f0615" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-6ce60b25-9e73-4967-bbd8-5beb8b78e202" facs="#m-9fdcf01d-dfb4-4f3b-bf2c-5299eae80ed6" label="lyrics-like">é-a in fascícu-los ad combu-réndum: trí-ti-cum autem</l><l xml:id="m-8a8006a6-ef32-4651-badd-830dfecd0562" facs="#m-13b5eca2-cbea-47cf-99ae-32645f5aa4f4" label="lyrics-like">congregá-te in hor-re-um mé-um, dí-cit Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-36df9b32-b2c6-4974-8279-14f98eae05d9" facs="#m-d279cadb-728c-4a3b-8ee4-8a25b889fd7e" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-820d8e62-ffa4-4afd-b7fe-603004d405a5" facs="#m-ec35bbe7-5a15-4e61-84b0-3e9344439828" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. I. g. p. 207.</l><l xml:id="m-5d3ed400-017c-466e-b7c6-7cbc0618aa2c" facs="#m-608dfe23-5221-439a-9a1a-dcb94dcb38bf" label="text-like">The Sixth Sunday after the Epiphany.</l><l xml:id="m-70f022de-e957-4670-8766-791d0e9c7cd1" facs="#m-f0d2abbe-c30b-4e10-bfff-c4416183e878" label="text-like">As on the third Sunday, except the following</l><l xml:id="m-a6ca5470-03ff-47a2-a6c2-eb58f24fe623" facs="#m-2bb63fa8-fcb6-4946-bf8c-1ab5365f5aad" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-fe4961f0-a199-4310-9ce0-5ecd9b689237" facs="#m-a4e3f762-77dd-40de-8892-0835a3b7fb6c" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-31ef7483-51dc-47d1-99ae-4a782d723376" facs="#m-3cf99d9d-d447-433b-844c-90fd5abb03a0" label="lyrics-like">DRaesta, quaésumus omnípotens ] et dictis exsequámur, et factis. Per</l><l xml:id="m-abb9080e-5271-4537-a686-a9d4b631c9e6" facs="#m-059639e6-2703-44ad-b771-b01545ab1702" label="ambiguous">L Deus:t ut semper rationabilia</l><l xml:id="m-ea160212-5935-45a8-9c3d-c579872836d0" facs="#m-cb0f3e37-e2d5-43f6-ace4-7c4fbafa0512" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-1a3e618e-54c6-49dc-9c91-c977aa945b69" facs="#m-599c45ee-180a-42c0-8c7c-85974e4bd580" label="lyrics-like">meditántes, * quae tibi sunt plácita,</l><l xml:id="m-f5d6837d-ee38-419f-9900-ce1d15ac786d" facs="#m-592a3e1c-047a-403d-8c6a-575b9035ce86" label="text-like">Second Collect. A cunctis. p. 198. Third at the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-6f76e19a-bac0-4731-aadc-3171b186e473" facs="#m-af7bfa29-ac62-4f40-a658-bd433cb8a873" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Thessalonicenses.</l><l xml:id="m-78374eef-88c1-49e7-bacf-f59a40a07a6f" facs="#m-2e59c666-5d82-43c5-8fcf-0660e8fec510" label="ambiguous">1. Thess. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-2da809a1-c845-4804-8c68-147c3b879674" facs="#m-1655f34c-1cad-48e8-a8cd-9c3e437e9fcf" label="lyrics-like">L'Ratres: Grátias ágimus Deo l vestram : quia Evangélium nostrum</l><l xml:id="m-23076efd-42d3-4330-995d-666580c4c300" facs="#m-910c86a8-fa48-4800-a1dc-99d612ca8111" label="lyrics-like">semper pro ómnibus vobis, me¬</l><l xml:id="m-0f9ae71b-effb-4dbc-a4ad-4ecf852ed901" facs="#m-0c996249-2425-4ce8-8305-fd9433e90815" label="lyrics-like">non fuit ad vos in sermóne tantum,</l><l xml:id="m-5e7e3aa7-2f13-4d4d-9a96-6c215bb400aa" facs="#m-69ca4e79-3c4a-4230-9be9-6eee1b19c728" label="lyrics-like">móriam vestri faciéntes in oratió¬</l><l xml:id="m-372a7291-1452-4081-9c3a-8b0cd2597f89" facs="#m-63ab07f5-bb1b-4cbd-a3a9-5e60b2caae43" label="lyrics-like">sed et in virtúte, et in Spiritu San¬</l><l xml:id="m-f5d8bc4b-5c85-4a95-a71a-3757171cab71" facs="#m-836fb0ba-9f4f-48aa-a9e1-f4c5c0794314" label="lyrics-like">nibus nostris sine intermissióne, mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-80cde221-114a-4a87-907b-8e5b236d77f4" facs="#m-d6d7d121-a562-45ea-8f58-e3d5b358781a" label="lyrics-like">cto, et in plenitúdine multa, sicut</l><l xml:id="m-a976b832-52e0-4a65-b9a8-c75ddfa66f1e" facs="#m-2109d354-bc03-4e2d-a55a-6913b555f486" label="lyrics-like">mores óperis fídei vestrae, et labó¬</l><l xml:id="m-8dfeb90a-7bdc-4f51-abf0-69ac1328edf3" facs="#m-d89a1fd6-18ab-42fa-8dc0-fa379a896c13" label="lyrics-like">scitis quales fuérimus in vobis pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-4af68161-659b-4654-805e-3e339a498856" facs="#m-919d940d-c216-49b6-9762-a9e757de438b" label="lyrics-like">pter vos. Et vos imitatóres nostri</l><l xml:id="m-4da9d8ed-cbc1-455c-801b-380aad876674" facs="#m-a511f40c-a4e8-4884-997d-06d7132b1428" label="lyrics-like">ris, et caritátis, et sustinéntiae spei</l><l xml:id="m-bdaab264-cec6-4616-9ce5-b0035da9ee89" facs="#m-45fb8503-5f7c-4f2a-a806-5edb2f5f809a" label="lyrics-like">Dómini nostri Jesu Christi, ante</l><l xml:id="m-4e6a9fe1-0beb-4428-bf9b-4de4ad39c669" facs="#m-c4f43272-da7c-4884-8564-f125d37ecd9e" label="lyrics-like">facti estis, et Dómini, excipiéntes</l><l xml:id="m-7c8f4aef-14c4-473f-a538-23bfd7d5a916" facs="#m-fa26ab94-7d39-4a65-9b8a-7b122778af1e" label="lyrics-like">verbum in tribulatióné multa, cum</l><l xml:id="m-18f78e7a-b881-4bfe-ba2f-cbab81fcd92a" facs="#m-b2668e90-4a38-4981-aa01-e5e84602831b" label="lyrics-like">Deum, et Patrem nostrum : sciéntes</l><l xml:id="m-f951c002-d95f-4bd8-a405-2c7eba93961f" facs="#m-4759ced9-3213-465c-a2fe-e64642b71d48" label="lyrics-like">fratres, dilécti a Deo, electiónem</l><l xml:id="m-835a3784-e08a-425b-bd93-57bfda24525d" facs="#m-ef7e7ef6-5a16-4510-9f54-dce90aa3442a" label="lyrics-like">gáudio Spiritus Sancti: ita ut facti</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
